{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the Wasteland</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate a super-heavy tank alone through the remnants of a ruined world. Discover hidden secrets and face dangers at every turn. You are protected by 140 tons of steel, but will it be enough?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Tank</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/fa93ca2670b01bb682d88f940581cd56.poster.avif?t=1761491481\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/fa93ca2670b01bb682d88f940581cd56.webm?t=1761491481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/fa93ca2670b01bb682d88f940581cd56.mp4?t=1761491481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between missions, return to your bunker to refuel, add oxygen, and enhance your tank\u2019s systems. Upgrade your machine to extend your reach into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Steel and Fire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/c23ebdaa71c84593a4c13fe4f5f201c2.poster.avif?t=1761491481\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/c23ebdaa71c84593a4c13fe4f5f201c2.webm?t=1761491481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/c23ebdaa71c84593a4c13fe4f5f201c2.mp4?t=1761491481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage enemy tanks and alien creatures with your powerful 128 mm cannon and a secondary 75 mm gun. Every shot counts, and a single mistake can turn triumph into ruin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prepare for the Next Expedition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/222ea1c00186faf9a1c5752b45c8301e.poster.avif?t=1761491481\" width=800 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/222ea1c00186faf9a1c5752b45c8301e.webm?t=1761491481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/extras/222ea1c00186faf9a1c5752b45c8301e.mp4?t=1761491481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your tank with additional modules to boost performance and handle new challenges. Adapt your machine and get ready for the dangers ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Atmospheric Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a tense, atmospheric world with lowpoly, stylized visuals. Breaking Armor combines horror, tactical tank combat, and the eerie uncertainty of a planet reshaped by catastrophe.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4087530?t=1761491481","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/8b0383966fbb169ad8defb689219b6ed9422a4d9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761491481","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/e133609f5e618d9d5187d87704daafa9735023d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761491481","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4087530/e133609f5e618d9d5187d87704daafa9735023d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761491481","categories